@startuml
title Step 6 - Order confirmation and completion (final validation)

actor person
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM
participant "ProductOrderCapture\n& Validation" as POCV
participant "ProductInventory" as PI
participant "SupplyChainMgt" as SCM
participant "EventMgt" as Event

activate EM
activate POCV

== Order final validation ==

POCV --> EM : 120 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(SessionId, ProcessId4, available actions:\nTaskId10 require order confirmation)

EM -> EM : 121 display final order completion form\nand request confirmation
person -> EM : 122 click on confirm
EM --> POCV : 123 **TMF701 Process** PATCH /process/4/task/10\nSessionId, Confirmed

alt Product inventory updated (if product previously created)
    POCV -> PI : 124 **TMF637 Product Inventory Mgt** PATCH /product/123
    activate PI
    PI --> POCV : 125 **TMF637** 200\nProduct representation
    deactivate PI
else Product inventory creation (if product not yet created)
    POCV -> PI : 126 **TMF637 Product Inventory Mgt** POST /product
    activate PI
    PI --> POCV : 127 **TMF637** 201 Created\nProduct representation
    deactivate PI
end

POCV --> POCV : 128 **TMF622 Product Order Mgt** PATCH /productOrder/7\nto change the status of the productOrder to 'acknowledged'

note over POCV, EM : Order capture triggers a welcome process to continue the interaction flow with EngagementManagement

POCV -> POCV : 129 Check productOrder validity
POCV -> POCV : 130 **TMF622 Product Order Mgt** PATCH /productOrder/7\nto change to state inProgress.accepted

opt Management of reservation
    POCV -> SCM : 131 **TMF687 Stock Mgt** POST /reserveProductStock\n(Box Maxi Strawberry Red, geoSite23)
    activate SCM
    SCM --> POCV : 132 **TMF687** 201 Created\nProduct reserved
    deactivate SCM
end

POCV -> Event : 133 **TMF688 Event Mgt** POST /processStateChangeEvent\nProcess OrderCapture Completed
POCV -> Event : 134 **TMF688 Event Mgt** POST /productOrderStateChangeEvent\nA new order in accepted state

deactivate POCV
deactivate EM

@enduml
